{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-08-27T19:03:40.083Z","embed":{"$type":"app.bsky.embed.images","images":[{"alt":"Instructional image titled \"Hide your posts from non-followers in Discover\" accompanied by a screenshot of the \"privacy and security\" options from the Bluesky settings menu. \"Ask apps to hide my posts from algorithmic recommendations\" is toggled to the \"on\" state.","aspectRatio":{"height":1968,"width":3300},"image":{"$type":"blob","mimeType":"image/jpeg","ref":{"$link":"bafkreiev5vdn5i6c4rfaakbzypvqlpnzbapaahooyz3k6np33z7ayhiuxu"},"size":1959010}}]},"langs":["en"],"text":"Now you can opt out of having your posts shown to non-followers in the Discover feed.\n\nWe know not everyone wants to go viral. Sometimes you're just posting for your followers. This is one of a few updates we're working on to give you more control over your experience and help you find your people."}